Changes made in this fork (summary):
  - Renamed the product to "Hark Browser Agent".
  - Added remote control: the Hark Bridge (bridge/), a Node.js program with an HTTP API, an MCP server
    (Streamable HTTP and stdio) and an OpenAPI spec, and the extension's Remote settings, worker connection,
    toolbar badge and side panel banner (src/extension/remote.ts, src/extension/remote-commands.ts,
    src/store/remote.ts, src/options/RemoteSection.tsx, src/side-panel/RemoteBanner.tsx).
  - Added a Python client and a Tailscale helper (client/).
  - Added "Lite mode" (src/extension/agent-session.ts litePort, Settings > General).
  - Added Groq and Together AI presets, and made "Test connection" work on every provider card,
    including providers with no models yet.

